examples.question_text:
Determine whether the triangle is right-angled. The diagram is not to scale.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=1cm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black}]
\coordinate (A) at (0,0);
\coordinate (B) at (4,0);
\coordinate (C) at (1,2.3);
\draw[black] (A)--(B)--(C)--cycle;
\path (A)--(B) node[midway,below] {$11$ cm};
\path (A)--(C) node[midway,above left] {$7$ cm};
\path (B)--(C) node[midway,above right] {$9$ cm};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
